{"file":"nous-contacter/index.html","title":"Nous contacter | Alaya Fine Jewelry","description":"Joindre Alaya Fine Jewelry : téléphone et WhatsApp +39 371 3446794, contact, ou rendez-vous à l'atelier.","texts":[{"i":0,"tag":"p","cls":"surtitre","plain":true,"text":"Service client"},{"i":1,"tag":"h1","cls":"","plain":true,"text":"Nous contacter"},{"i":2,"tag":"p","cls":"edito-ligne","plain":true,"text":"Une question sur une pièce, une taille, une commande : c’est l’atelier qui répond."},{"i":3,"tag":"span","cls":"cc-quoi","plain":true,"text":"Par téléphone"},{"i":4,"tag":"span","cls":"cc-valeur","plain":true,"text":"+39 371 3446794"},{"i":5,"tag":"span","cls":"cc-note","plain":true,"text":"L’atelier répond du lundi au vendredi, de 9h00 à 19h00."},{"i":6,"tag":"span","cls":"cc-quoi","plain":true,"text":"Par WhatsApp"},{"i":7,"tag":"span","cls":"cc-valeur","plain":true,"text":"+39 371 3446794"},{"i":8,"tag":"span","cls":"cc-note","plain":true,"text":"Envoyez une photo, une idée, une question."},{"i":9,"tag":"span","cls":"cc-quoi","plain":true,"text":"Par e-mail"},{"i":10,"tag":"span","cls":"cc-valeur","plain":true,"text":"contact"},{"i":11,"tag":"span","cls":"cc-note","plain":true,"text":"Réponse sous un jour ouvré."},{"i":12,"tag":"span","cls":"cc-quoi","plain":true,"text":"À l'atelier"},{"i":13,"tag":"span","cls":"cc-valeur","plain":true,"text":"Prendre rendez-vous"},{"i":14,"tag":"span","cls":"cc-note","plain":true,"text":"Pour essayer, comparer, ou faire dessiner une pièce."},{"i":15,"tag":"h2","cls":"","plain":true,"text":"Écrire un mot"},{"i":16,"tag":"span","cls":"","plain":true,"text":"Prénom et nom"},{"i":17,"tag":"span","cls":"","plain":true,"text":"E-mail"},{"i":18,"tag":"span","cls":"","plain":true,"text":"Votre message"},{"i":19,"tag":"button","cls":"btn-panier btn-panier--plein","plain":true,"text":"Envoyer"},{"i":20,"tag":"p","cls":"achat-note","plain":true,"text":"Le message ouvre votre logiciel de courrier, rien n'est envoyé sans vous."},{"i":21,"tag"